"of Medical Care in Diabetes. The ADA publishes the Standards of Care "
"annually in Diabetes Care as a free supplement. Each section covers a "
"specific clinical topic (e.g., glycemic goals, pharmacologic treatment, "
"cardiovascular risk management, diabetes technology). Returns section "
"titles, numbers, PMIDs, and PMC links. Use year parameter to access "
"specific editions (default: 2026)."
