"Useful for finding ADA recommendations on specific diabetes-related "
"topics such as glycemic targets, insulin therapy, GLP-1 receptor "
"agonists, SGLT2 inhibitors, gestational diabetes, diabetic kidney "
"disease, or diabetes technology."
